OL,3,ATrump signs order to remove endangered
OL,4,Aspecies protection for grey wolves
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has signed an executive
OL,7,Forder to remove endangered species
OL,8,Fprotection for the grey wolf and a
OL,9,Fsubspecies, the Mexican wolf.
OL,11,FThe US president's decision could pave
OL,12,Fthe way for pastoral farmers to kill
OL,13,Fthe canines to protect their livestock.
OL,14,FHis order said ranchers played a "vital
OL,15,Frole" in the food supply chain and
OL,16,FAmerican cultural heritage.
OL,18,FBut conservation groups have criticised
OL,19,Fthe move, saying it could derail
OL,20,Flong-term efforts to recover the
OL,21,Fendangered wolf populations.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
