OL,3,ATrump signs order to remove endangered
OL,4,Aspecies protection for grey wolves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were 319 Mexican wolves in the
OL,7,Fwild in the US in 2025, up from just
OL,8,Ffour when they were reintroduced in
OL,9,F1998, US Fish and Wildlife Service
OL,10,F(FWS) figures show.
